ather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the collection of intelligence data from various sources.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"unary\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity must be the last activity to occur in the process.\",\"template\":\"End\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Disseminate Information\",\"description\":\"The 'Disseminate Information' activity involves distributing finalized intelligence reports to relevant stakeholders.\"},\"target\":null,\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"If a 'Gather Intelligence' activity occurs, then an 'Analyze Data' activity must eventually occur after the 'Gather Intelligence' event at some point in the same process instance. There is no requirement on how soon or what events may occur in between. Multiple 'Gather Intelligence' can be pending at the same time, and a single 'Analyze Data' can fulfill the obligation for all preceding 'Gather Intelligence'. If 'Gather Intelligence' does not occur, the constraint imposes no obligation on the occurrence of 'Analyze Data'.\",\"template\":\"Response\",\"activation\":{\"name\":\"Gather Intelligence\",\"description\":\"The 'Gather Intelligence' activity represents the collection of intelligence data from various sources.\"},\"target\":{\"name\":\"Analyze Data\",\"description\":\"The 'Analyze Data' activity involves examining the gathered intelligence using analytical techniques.\"},\"activation_condition\":null,\"correlation_condition\":null,\"time_condition\":null,\"cardinality\":null},{\"type\":\"binary\",\"description\":\"An 'Analyze Data' event must be followed by an 'Identify Threats' event at some point later in the same process instance. Conversely, an 'Identify Threats' event can occur only if an 'Analy